    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Sauté chopped onion and minced garlic until softened.",
    "Add chopped callaloo, seared in a separate pan, and stir to combine.",
    "Add smoked paprika, allspice, thyme, and black pepper. Stir to combine.",
    "Add Scotch bonnet peppers and stir to combine.",
    "Bring to a boil, then reduce heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Remove from heat and let cool slightly before transferring to an ice bath to shock the callaloo.",
    "Drain and serve hot."
